          "value": "<p>Each councilor belongs to a clumsy Maw Hivemind. When three councilors have been defeated, their corpses and all remaining councilors coagulate into The <span style=\"font-family:var(--font-primary);font-size:var(--font-size-14)\">Assembled Council of Taltain.</span></p>\n<p>Remove all existing councilors from the arena and add the Assembled Council to the arena. </p>"
