        "deathNote": false,
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>The Ratfolk Doctor deals [[/r 2d8]] slashing damage to an adjacent creature and grafts a horrific composite of machinery and flesh to their body.</p><p> </p><p>The creature gains @Damage[6d8] temporary hitpoints, and their next Strike deals an additional 3d8 electricity damage. The target is then temporarily immune to Battle Graft for 1 day.</p><p>@UUID[Compendium.covalon.taltain-items.Item.FhqmgRsLb9fSbN24]{Effect: Battle Graft}</p>"
        },
