      "privateNotes": "<p>Carloni uses her Thunder-Thrower to target enemies that her fellow councilors are attacking while she uses Battle Graft to nimbly \"heal\" her allies. If the opportunity presents itself to where she can hit a decent number of allies and/or enemies with Ultravolt!, she should take it, especially if it can also hit a pillar.</p>",
      "publicNotes": "<p><span style=\"font-family:'gg sans', 'Noto Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, 'Apple Symbols'\">A Maw aberration based on Covalon's former Head Doctor, Kelani Snowdrop (ysoki inventor), Carloni prefers grafting machinery and other experimental treatments instead of traditional medicine.</span></p>",
